<p> Thanks to the good people at the MIT Press, all of the figures
from <i>CBofN</i> may be freely used for non-commercial purposes.
Thus, if you are teaching a class, giving a lecture, or just want to
have them to look at, feel free to download and use any of the figures.

<p>
You may browse or download individual figures by selecting one of the
following thumbnail pages:

