<p> If you would like to have all of the figures, pick a distribution
that is appropriate for you.  Unix users will probably want tarballs
(<tt>TGZ</tt> format) and windows users should probably stick to the
ZIP files.  Distributions that contain GIF images, have figure
versions in 24, 100, and 300 DPI.

<ul> <li><a href="cbn-figs-all.tgz">cbn-figs-all.tgz</a> - Gzip'ed tar
file containing all figures in all formats and sizes. (35.19
MB)<br><br>

<li><a href="cbn-figs-all.zip">cbn-figs-all.zip</a> - ZIP file
containing all figures in all formats and sizes.  (35.18 MB)<br><br>

<li><a href="cbn-figs-eps.tgz">cbn-figs-eps.tgz</a> - Gzip'ed tar file
containing all figures in encapsulated PostScript format.
(14.48 MB)<br><br>

<li><a href="cbn-figs-eps.zip">cbn-figs-eps.zip</a> -  ZIP file
containing all figures in encapsulated PostScript format. (14.39
MB)<br><br>

<li><a href="cbn-figs-gif.tgz">cbn-figs-gif.tgz</a> - Gzip'ed tar file
containing all figures in GIF format and all sizes. (15.09 MB)<br><br>

<li><a href="cbn-figs-gif.zip">cbn-figs-gif.zip</a> - ZIP file
containing all figures in GIF format and all sizes (15.12 MB)<br><br>

<li><a href="cbn-figs-pdf.tgz">cbn-figs-pdf.tgz</a> - Gzip'ed tar file
containing all figures in portable document format.  (5.60
MB)<br><br>

<li><a href="cbn-figs-pdf.zip">cbn-figs-pdf.zip</a> - ZIP file
containing all figures in portable document format.  (5.65 MB)<br><br>

</ul>


<p> Make sure to "shift click" these bad boys.  Because these are so
large, I'd be delighted to have volunteers mirror this site.  Any
takers?


